    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0037552ab6e09a05",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash Live：让音频 AI 更自然、更可靠",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40476fa637bd4ae5",
      "translationZh": "我们最新的语音模型提高了精度并降低了延迟，使语音交互更加流畅、自然且精确。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "161e1a3be4edaa89",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 团队软件工程师代表",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf6766fc2ee6a0d3",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 是 Google 质量最高的音频模型，专为自然且可靠的实时对话而设计。开发者可以通过 Google AI Studio 中的 Gemini Live API 访问它，企业则可将其用于客户体验。每个人都可以通过 Search Live 和 Gemini Live 体验它，目前支持超过 200 个国家。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "500d632ff20a598e",
      "translationZh": "“Gemini 3.1 Flash Live”来了，让 AI 音频听起来更自然、更可靠。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a925ca3f1b96dd7b",
      "translationZh": "这款新的音频模型速度更快，在理解语气方面表现更好，能够实现自然的对话。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f14ad9618eb5896c",
      "translationZh": "开发者可以使用它来构建语音代理，从而更可靠地处理复杂任务。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38b57d4ec6d43af7",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Live 和 Search Live 现在在多种语言中提供更有帮助的回复。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5964b77ecfaca1d6",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 的所有音频都经过水印处理，以帮助防止错误信息的传播。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "755f612d4eb07e00",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们借助 Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 推进了 Gemini 的实时对话能力，这是我们迄今为止质量最高的音频和语音模型。它提供了下一代以语音为先的 AI 所需的速度和自然节奏，为开发者、企业和普通用户提供了更直观的体验。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "859bf1e3b58d1543",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 在 Google 的各类产品中均可使用：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f18d70ce81d361fa",
      "translationZh": "开发者可通过 Google AI Studio 中的 Gemini Live API 进行预览",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    }
  ],
